<section class="tab cwnit-cyberdeck__body {{tab.cssClass}}" data-group="primary" data-tab="configuration">
  <div class="cwnit-cyberdeck__section-heading"><div><small>Hardware &amp; Interface</small><h2>Configuration</h2></div></div>
  {{#if cwnit.canConfigureAdvanced}}<section class="cwnit-cyberdeck__model-picker"><div><label for="cwnit-cyberdeck-model">Published Cyberdeck Model</label><select id="cwnit-cyberdeck-model" name="cwnitCyberdeckModel"><option value="">Custom / keep current values</option>{{#each cwnit.cyberdeckModels as |model|}}<option value="{{model.key}}" {{#if model.selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{model.name}} — Access +{{model.bonusAccess}}, Memory {{model.memory}}, Shielding {{model.shielding}}, CPU {{model.cpu}}, Enc {{model.encumbranceLabel}}, {{model.costLabel}}</option>{{/each}}</select><p>Applying a model writes its published base values to SWNR's native Cyberdeck fields. Programs and files are preserved.</p></div><button type="button" data-action="applyCyberdeckModel"><i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i> Apply Model Defaults</button></section>{{/if}}
  <dl class="cwnit-cyberdeck__configuration-summary"><div><dt>Bonus Access</dt><dd>+{{system.bonusAccess}}</dd></div><div><dt>CPU Capacity</dt><dd>{{system.cpu.max}}</dd></div><div><dt>Memory Capacity</dt><dd>{{system.memory.max}}</dd></div><div><dt>Base Shielding</dt><dd>{{system.baseShielding}}</dd></div><div><dt>Bonus Shielding</dt><dd>+{{system.bonusShielding}}</dd></div><div><dt>Encumbrance</dt><dd>{{system.encumberance}}</dd></div><div><dt>Cost</dt><dd>{{system.cost}}</dd></div></dl>
  {{#if cwnit.canConfigureAdvanced}}<details class="cwnit-cyberdeck__advanced"><summary><i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i> Advanced Configuration</summary><p>Stored source fields are editable. Derived totals are read-only and continue to be calculated by SWNR.</p>{{#if cwnit.hacker}}<section class="cwnit-cyberdeck__override"><div><h3>Access Testing Override</h3><p>Ignores the one-hour and once-per-day rules. Available to anyone permitted to use this Advanced Configuration panel.</p></div><button type="button" data-action="forceRefreshAccess"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> Force Refresh Access</button></section>{{/if}}<div class="cwnit-cyberdeck__advanced-grid">
    <label>Bonus Access<input type="number" name="system.bonusAccess" value="{{system.bonusAccess}}" /></label>
    <label>CPU Maximum<input type="number" name="system.cpu.max" value="{{system.cpu.max}}" min="0" /></label>
    <label>Memory Maximum<input type="number" name="system.memory.max" value="{{system.memory.max}}" min="0" /></label>
    <label>Shielding Current<input type="number" name="system.health.value" value="{{system.health.value}}" min="0" /></label>
    <label>Base Shielding<input type="number" name="system.baseShielding" value="{{system.baseShielding}}" min="0" /></label>
    <label>Bonus Shielding<input type="number" name="system.bonusShielding" value="{{system.bonusShielding}}" /></label>
    <label>Encumbrance<input type="number" name="system.encumberance" value="{{system.encumberance}}" min="0" /></label>
    <label>Cost<input type="number" name="system.cost" value="{{system.cost}}" min="0" /></label>
    <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="system.neuralBuffer" {{#if system.neuralBuffer}}checked{{/if}} /> Neural Buffer</label>
    <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="system.crownPenalty" {{#if system.crownPenalty}}checked{{/if}} /> VR Crown Penalty</label>
    <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="system.wirelessConnectionPenalty" {{#if system.wirelessConnectionPenalty}}checked{{/if}} /> Legacy Native Wireless Penalty</label>
  </div><div class="cwnit-cyberdeck__calculation"><h3>Access Calculation</h3><dl><div><dt>Hacker current / max</dt><dd>{{cwnit.resources.access.hackerValue}} / {{cwnit.resources.access.hackerMax}}</dd></div><div><dt>Deck Bonus Access</dt><dd>+{{cwnit.resources.access.bonus}}</dd></div><div><dt>Resolved current / max</dt><dd>{{cwnit.resources.access.value}} / {{cwnit.resources.access.max}}</dd></div></dl><p>Network Console session mode is the authoritative wireless penalty path. The legacy native field is preserved here only for diagnostics and native-sheet compatibility.</p></div></details>{{/if}}
</section>
